  "slug": "it-outsourcing-vs-in-house",
  "title": "IT Outsourcing Vs In-House Hiring: Cost Comparison for CA Businesses",
  "excerpt": "Compare IT outsourcing vs in-house hiring costs for California businesses. Discover real savings, hidden expenses, and the best model to scale efficiently.",
  "date": "2026-04-23",
